# The Java 21 variant of org.example.spi.weaver: same classes except CallSiteWeaver (the hook falls
# back to the constant pool technique) and CallerFinder (own Java 21 version), same manifest
# instructions. The Bundle-SymbolicName comes
# from the artifactId, so both variants can sit in one repository. The ~ keeps the headers set here.
-include: ~${.}/../org.example.spi.weaver/bnd.bnd

Bundle-Description: java.util.ServiceLoader across bundles without metadata, Java 21 variant: \
	WeavingHook that redirects ServiceLoader.load to ServiceLoaders.load in the constant pool, \
	backed by the META-INF/services registry of org.example.spi.core.
